---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import { business } from '../../data/business';

const whatsappMessage = encodeURIComponent("Hi Marc, I'd like to discuss a web project.");

const steps = [
  { num: '01', title: 'You order online', detail: 'Secure payment, guided questionnaire right away. You describe your business, your clients, what you want the site to do for you. 15 minutes, no more.', time: 'Day 0' },
  { num: '02', title: 'We align quickly', detail: 'A 15-minute call — phone, video, or written, your choice. I clarify the last few open questions. No lengthy meetings, no 40-slide kickoffs.', time: 'Day 1' },
  { num: '03', title: 'I build everything', detail: 'Unique design, copywriting, optimised images, SEO, Schema.org, Open Graph. Everything. You touch nothing. I don\'t come back to ask "do you prefer blue or green?" every two hours.', time: 'Days 2–6' },
  { num: '04', title: 'You see it, you sign off', detail: 'Private preview link. You send your full list of changes in one go — I fix everything at once, not across ten rounds of feedback. Then we go live on your domain.', time: 'Day 7' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How it works — Marc M | Process & Method"
  description="Full process: how I deliver a bespoke website in 7 days at €490. No templates, no WordPress, no middlemen."
  lang="en"
  frPath="/methode"
  enPath="/en/method"
>

  <section class="w-full relative px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: #0D0D0D;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 -left-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full opacity-10 blur-3xl" style="background: #E86C47;"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl relative z-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4" style="color: #E86C47; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">How it works</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">
        A site at €490.<br/>
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E86C47] to-[#F5C8B3] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Not a compromise.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        The question everyone has: is it actually serious at this price? Let me explain where the number comes from, and how it works in practice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EDITORIAL -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text)] font-medium mb-10">
        €490 isn't the price of a cut-rate site. It's the price of a site built by someone who has eliminated everything that inflates quotes without making better sites.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">
        No office with rent and overheads. No sales rep taking 20% of the project to shake your hand. No project manager bridging you and the developer — losing half the brief in transit. No weekly "progress update" meetings.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-12">
        Just me, the tools, and the work. 100% remote, with clients in Paris, Lyon, Strasbourg, Metz, and across Europe. What takes weeks at an agency takes days here — because every step is tooled and repeatable. The time saved goes back into the price, not my margin.
      </p>

      <div class="border-l-4 pl-6 md:pl-8 mb-12" style="border-color: var(--color-accent);">
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text)] italic">
          An agency charging €2,500 may do excellent work. But they're also billing their offices, their sales rep, their project manager, and their meetings. The code produced isn't 5× better — the overhead is 5× higher. Here, you pay for the actual work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">
        I use modern tools — Astro, Tailwind CSS, Cloudflare — not WordPress with 40 plugins to maintain, update, and patch every time one of them creates a security hole. Sites that load in under a second. Lighthouse scores that no agency guarantees in writing, because they know it's not what they'll deliver.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        And 33 projects delivered counts for something. Each client taught me something. Past mistakes don't resurface in your pages — they're fixed into the process before you ever see them.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STEPS -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20 border-y" style="border-color: var(--color-border);">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.2em;">The process</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-2">4 steps, 7 days</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-10 max-w-xl">Here's what actually happens — not the polished brochure version.</p>
      <div class="space-y-0">
        {steps.map((e, i) => (
          <div class="flex gap-6 pb-10 relative">
            {i < steps.length - 1 && <div class="absolute left-6 top-14 bottom-0 w-px bg-neutral-200"></div>}
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-sm z-10" style="background-color: #E86C47;">{e.num}</div>
            <div class="pt-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">{e.title}</h3>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 bg-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">{e.time}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] text-sm leading-relaxed">{e.detail}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INCLUSIONS -->
  <section class="w-full px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20" style="background: #FAFAFA;">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">What every site includes</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-8">No à la carte checklist to upsell extras. All of this is included, by default, in every project.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-0 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {[
          'Unique design — built for your image, not a template',
          'Copywriting — from 15 min of conversation with you',
          'Ultra-fast — Lighthouse 100/100 guaranteed',
          'SEO + GEO — Google and AI (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude)',
          'Responsive mobile — tested on all screens',
          'Lifetime hosting — Cloudflare, no subscription',
          'Your domain, your rules — I don\'t lock you in',
          'Simple CMS — edit your content like an email',
          'Legal pages — GDPR compliant',
          'Schema.org — structured data for search engines',
          'Open Graph — clean previews on social media',
          'HTTPS / SSL — included, automatic',
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 border-b border-neutral-100">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" style="color: #E86C47;" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NOTE -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-10 md:px-8 md:py-12 border-t border-neutral-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl flex items-start gap-4">
      <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">🤿</span>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
        I work 100% remote — from Metz, from Thailand between dives, from wherever I am. That's not a constraint, it's a freedom that benefits everyone: I choose my clients, I work without distractions, and it shows in what I deliver.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="w-full relative px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: #0D0D0D;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px;"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center relative z-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to start?</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 mb-8">Ordering takes 10 minutes. Your site arrives in 7 days.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <Button href="/en/services" variant="primary">See the offer — €490</Button>
        <Button href={`https://wa.me/${business.whatsapp}?text=${whatsappMessage}`} variant="secondary" external>A question first →</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
